#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:8
msgid ""
"Discord / 微信（iLink）通道与全局网关选项保存在 PostgreSQL "
"`habitat_runtime_config`，**不要**写进 `~/.anima/config.yaml`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "在哪里改"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:12
msgid "Shell → **Habitat 服务** → **服务配置**："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 段                      | 作用                                            |\n"
"| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **网关** (`gateway`)    | 全局 `tool_display`（工具消息展示模式）         |\n"
"| **Discord** (`discord`) | Bot token、启用开关、提及/频道策略、home 频道等 |\n"
"| **微信** (`weixin`)     | iLink token、`base_url`、账号字段、启用开关     |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:20
msgid ""
"敏感字段支持明文、`vault(\"id\",\"field\")` 或 `env(\"KEY\")`。微信亦可仅用环"
"境变量 `WEIXIN_ILINK_TOKEN`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "启用与生效"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:25
msgid ""
"`enabled: false`：即使有 token 也不启动该通道（默认有 token 且未禁用则启"
"动）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:25
msgid ""
"保存后需 **重启 Habitat / anima service** 才会重新 `discoverPlatforms`；当前"
"不支持热重载。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "测试连接"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:29
msgid "Discord / 微信段提供「测试连接」："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:32
msgid "Discord：临时 Bot `login`，成功后立即断开。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:32
msgid "微信：调用 iLink `notifyStart`（与 adapter 启动探测一致）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:34
msgid "表单里 token 显示为 `***` 时，探测会回退到已保存的未脱敏值。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "安全"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/message-gateway.md:37
msgid ""
"Gateway token 放 Vault 或 env；Discord / WeChat **不能**解锁 User vault。见 "
"[`security.md`](security.md)。"
msgstr ""
